paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p031","quote":"黥布反，以車騎將軍先出，攻布別將於相，破之，斬亞將樓煩將三人。又進擊破布上柱國軍及大司馬軍。又進破布別將肥誅。嬰身生得左司馬一人，所將卒斬其小將十人，追北至淮上。益食二千五百戶。布已破，高帝歸，定令嬰食穎陰五千戶，除前所食邑。凡從得二千石二人，別破軍十六，降城四十六，定國一，郡二，縣五十二，得將軍二人，柱國、相國各一人，二千石十人。"}],"rationale":"按本篇分傳、明示姓名與敘事承接限定異稱。酈寄字況據第14段；夏侯嬰的嬰限定第16至21段，灌嬰限定第22至33段，桓嬰另人。第6與20、28段楚王信和反韓王信分人；未詳名王侯不補名。同名跨篇同指另待逐項證據。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p031","text":"黥布反，以車騎將軍先出，攻布別將於相，破之，斬亞將樓煩將三人。又進擊破布上柱國軍及大司馬軍。又進破布別將肥誅。嬰身生得左司馬一人，所將卒斬其小將十人，追北至淮上。益食二千五百戶。布已破，高帝歸，定令嬰食穎陰五千戶，除前所食邑。凡從得二千石二人，別破軍十六，降城四十六，定國一，郡二，縣五十二，得將軍二人，柱國、相國各一人，二千石十人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"664_wah_z4z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"664_wah_z4z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"664_wah_z4z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0049","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"664_wah_z4z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"肥誅","kind":"person","person_id":"ns2_4jx_cpp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"mdl_l60_pwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0089","start":89,"end":90,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"664_wah_z4z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m031-0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"mdl_l60_pwy